            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery dissection caused by angioplasty balloon rupture.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three cases of coronary angioplasty balloon rupture complicated by coronary artery dissection are described. Factors that may predispose to this previously undescribed and potentially devastating complication are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
